sequenceDiagram
participant PM as Project Manager
participant WO as Workforce Orchestrator
participant EL as Eligibility Engine
participant AI as Crew Optimizer
participant HR as HR/Operations Approver
PM->>WO: Submit labor/crew requirement
WO->>EL: Validate candidates and credentials
EL-->>WO: Eligible worker pool + exceptions
WO->>AI: Request ranked crew alternatives
AI-->>WO: Explainable recommendations
WO->>HR: Route assignment for approval
HR-->>WO: Approve/modify/reject
WO-->>PM: Publish crew assignment and notifications
